# Allowlist. Everything at the top level is ignored unless named below, so personal files kept
# next to the tool (resume, notes, fact file, transcripts, backups) can never be committed by
# accident. To publish a new top-level file, add a `!/name` line here on purpose.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE
!/dashboard/

.DS_Store
CLAUDE.local.md
